          {
            "title": "Schema",
            "id": 121018,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per elencare le tabelle, useremo <code>sqlite_schema</code> perché stiamo usando SQLite. <code>sqlite_schema</code> è una tabella che memorizza lo schema di un database.</p><p>Uno schema contiene informazioni su un database, inclusi i dettagli sulle tabelle.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE past_events( &#xA;    name varchar(255), &#xA;    entry int, &#xA;    attendees int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;CREATE TABLE events( &#xA;    name varchar(255), &#xA;    registered int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;CREATE TABLE crew( &#xA; name varchar(255), &#xA; id int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO crew(name, id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Aisha&quot;, 342); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO crew(name, id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Matt&quot;, 123); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO crew(name, id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Kiana&quot;, 839); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO past_events(name, entry, attendees) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Pride Party&quot;, 10, 79); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO past_events(name, entry, attendees) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Classical Day&quot;, 15, 76); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO past_events(name, entry, attendees) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Wine tasting&quot;, 8, 43); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO events(name, registered) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Fundraiser&quot;, 37); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO events(name, registered) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Game zone&quot;, 14);\"><tables><table name=\"past_events\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"entry\" /><header content=\"attendees\" /></row><row><data content=\"Pride Party\" /><data content=\"10\" /><data content=\"79\" /></row><row><data content=\"Classical Day\" /><data content=\"15\" /><data content=\"76\" /></row><row><data content=\"Wine tasting\" /><data content=\"8\" /><data content=\"43\" /></row></table><table name=\"events\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"registered\" /></row><row><data content=\"Fundraiser\" /><data content=\"37\" /></row><row><data content=\"Game zone\" /><data content=\"14\" /></row></table><table name=\"crew\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"id\" /></row><row><data content=\"Aisha\" /><data content=\"342\" /></row><row><data content=\"Matt\" /><data content=\"123\" /></row><row><data content=\"Kiana\" /><data content=\"839\" /></row></table></tables></database><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sqlite_schema;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"27\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><header content=\"type\" /><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"tbl_name\" /><header content=\"rootpage\" /><header content=\"sql\" /></row><row><data content=\"table\" /><data content=\"past_events\" /><data content=\"past_events\" /><data content=\"2\" /><data content=\"CREATE TABLE past_events(&#xA;    name varchar(255),&#xA;    entry int,&#xA;    attendees int&#xA;)\" /></row><row><data content=\"table\" /><data content=\"events\" /><data content=\"events\" /><data content=\"3\" /><data content=\"CREATE TABLE events(&#xA;    name varchar(255),&#xA;    registered int&#xA;)\" /></row><row><data content=\"table\" /><data content=\"crew\" /><data content=\"crew\" /><data content=\"4\" /><data content=\"CREATE TABLE crew(&#xA; name varchar(255),&#xA; id int&#xA;)\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>sqlite_schema</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Table type",
            "id": 121020,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Uno schema memorizza molte informazioni su un database. Specifichiamo che vogliamo solo le tabelle.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE past_events( &#xA;    name varchar(255), &#xA;    entry int, &#xA;    attendees int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;CREATE TABLE events( &#xA;    name varchar(255), &#xA;    registered int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;CREATE TABLE crew( &#xA; name varchar(255), &#xA; id int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO crew(name, id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Aisha&quot;, 342); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO crew(name, id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Matt&quot;, 123); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO crew(name, id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Kiana&quot;, 839); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO past_events(name, entry, attendees) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Pride Party&quot;, 10, 79); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO past_events(name, entry, attendees) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Classical Day&quot;, 15, 76); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO past_events(name, entry, attendees) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Wine tasting&quot;, 8, 43); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO events(name, registered) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Fundraiser&quot;, 37); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO events(name, registered) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Game zone&quot;, 14);\"><tables><table name=\"past_events\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"entry\" /><header content=\"attendees\" /></row><row><data content=\"Pride Party\" /><data content=\"10\" /><data content=\"79\" /></row><row><data content=\"Classical Day\" /><data content=\"15\" /><data content=\"76\" /></row><row><data content=\"Wine tasting\" /><data content=\"8\" /><data content=\"43\" /></row></table><table name=\"events\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"registered\" /></row><row><data content=\"Fundraiser\" /><data content=\"37\" /></row><row><data content=\"Game zone\" /><data content=\"14\" /></row></table><table name=\"crew\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"id\" /></row><row><data content=\"Aisha\" /><data content=\"342\" /></row><row><data content=\"Matt\" /><data content=\"123\" /></row><row><data content=\"Kiana\" /><data content=\"839\" /></row></table></tables></database><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sqlite_schema \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" = \" /><text value=\"&quot;table&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"49\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><header content=\"type\" /><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"tbl_name\" /><header content=\"rootpage\" /><header content=\"sql\" /></row><row><data content=\"table\" /><data content=\"past_events\" /><data content=\"past_events\" /><data content=\"2\" /><data content=\"CREATE TABLE past_events(&#xA;    name varchar(255),&#xA;    entry int,&#xA;    attendees int&#xA;)\" /></row><row><data content=\"table\" /><data content=\"events\" /><data content=\"events\" /><data content=\"3\" /><data content=\"CREATE TABLE events(&#xA;    name varchar(255),&#xA;    registered int&#xA;)\" /></row><row><data content=\"table\" /><data content=\"crew\" /><data content=\"crew\" /><data content=\"4\" /><data content=\"CREATE TABLE crew(&#xA; name varchar(255),&#xA; id int&#xA;)\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>type</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>\"table\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Selecting only the name",
            "id": 121019,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per creare un elenco di tabelle, ci serve solo la colonna <code>name</code>. Quindi eseguiamo una <code>SELECT</code> per ottenerla!</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE past_events( &#xA;    name varchar(255), &#xA;    entry int, &#xA;    attendees int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;CREATE TABLE events( &#xA;    name varchar(255), &#xA;    registered int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;CREATE TABLE crew( &#xA; name varchar(255), &#xA; id int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO crew(name, id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Aisha&quot;, 342); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO crew(name, id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Matt&quot;, 123); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO crew(name, id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Kiana&quot;, 839); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO past_events(name, entry, attendees) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Pride Party&quot;, 10, 79); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO past_events(name, entry, attendees) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Classical Day&quot;, 15, 76); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO past_events(name, entry, attendees) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Wine tasting&quot;, 8, 43); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO events(name, registered) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Fundraiser&quot;, 37); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO events(name, registered) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Game zone&quot;, 14);\"><tables><table name=\"past_events\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"entry\" /><header content=\"attendees\" /></row><row><data content=\"Pride Party\" /><data content=\"10\" /><data content=\"79\" /></row><row><data content=\"Classical Day\" /><data content=\"15\" /><data content=\"76\" /></row><row><data content=\"Wine tasting\" /><data content=\"8\" /><data content=\"43\" /></row></table><table name=\"events\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"registered\" /></row><row><data content=\"Fundraiser\" /><data content=\"37\" /></row><row><data content=\"Game zone\" /><data content=\"14\" /></row></table><table name=\"crew\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"id\" /></row><row><data content=\"Aisha\" /><data content=\"342\" /></row><row><data content=\"Matt\" /><data content=\"123\" /></row><row><data content=\"Kiana\" /><data content=\"839\" /></row></table></tables></database><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sqlite_schema \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" = \" /><text value=\"&quot;table&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"11\" /></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><header content=\"name\" /></row><row><data content=\"past_events\" /></row><row><data content=\"events\" /></row><row><data content=\"crew\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>name</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "DROP TABLE",
            "id": 121021,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ora che abbiamo l'elenco delle tabelle, eliminiamo l'intera tabella <code>past_events</code> con la query <code>DROP TABLE</code>.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE past_events( &#xA;    name varchar(255), &#xA;    entry int, &#xA;    attendees int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;CREATE TABLE events( &#xA;    name varchar(255), &#xA;    registered int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;CREATE TABLE crew( &#xA; name varchar(255), &#xA; id int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO crew(name, id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Aisha&quot;, 342); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO crew(name, id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Matt&quot;, 123); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO crew(name, id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Kiana&quot;, 839); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO past_events(name, entry, attendees) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Pride Party&quot;, 10, 79); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO past_events(name, entry, attendees) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Classical Day&quot;, 15, 76); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO past_events(name, entry, attendees) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Wine tasting&quot;, 8, 43); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO events(name, registered) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Fundraiser&quot;, 37); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO events(name, registered) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Game zone&quot;, 14);\"><tables><table name=\"past_events\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"entry\" /><header content=\"attendees\" /></row><row><data content=\"Pride Party\" /><data content=\"10\" /><data content=\"79\" /></row><row><data content=\"Classical Day\" /><data content=\"15\" /><data content=\"76\" /></row><row><data content=\"Wine tasting\" /><data content=\"8\" /><data content=\"43\" /></row></table><table name=\"events\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"registered\" /></row><row><data content=\"Fundraiser\" /><data content=\"37\" /></row><row><data content=\"Game zone\" /><data content=\"14\" /></row></table><table name=\"crew\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"id\" /></row><row><data content=\"Aisha\" /><data content=\"342\" /></row><row><data content=\"Matt\" /><data content=\"123\" /></row><row><data content=\"Kiana\" /><data content=\"839\" /></row></table></tables></database><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"DROP\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" past_events; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sqlite_schema \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" = \" /><text value=\"&quot;table&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"10\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><header content=\"name\" /></row><row><data content=\"events\" /></row><row><data content=\"crew\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>DROP</code>, seguito da <code>TABLE</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 121022,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale delle seguenti affermazioni è vera per uno schema?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Uno schema contiene informazioni su un database</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Uno schema contiene solo informazioni sulle tabelle</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Uno schema contiene informazioni su un database.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un database contiene diverse tabelle e altri dettagli strutturali. Quale affermazione descrive correttamente il suo schema?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Contiene informazioni sulla struttura del database</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Contiene soltanto le righe memorizzate in una tabella</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Contiene i risultati della query più recente</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Contiene informazioni sulla struttura del database.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 2",
            "id": 121023,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dove viene archiviato l'elenco delle tabelle nel tuo database?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">schema</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">query</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere schema.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi una tabella <code>payments</code> e poi esamini l'elenco delle tabelle del database. Dove è memorizzato questo elenco?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nello schema</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nella query che ha creato <code>payments</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nella prima riga della tabella <code>payments</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere Nello schema.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 3",
            "id": 121024,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come puoi eliminare una tabella da un database SQLite?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>DROP TABLE</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>DELETE TABLE</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>DROP TABLE</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Devi rimuovere l'intera tabella <code>archive</code> da un database SQLite, struttura compresa. Quale comando devi usare?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>DROP TABLE</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>DELETE FROM</code>, perché eliminare ogni riga rimuove anche la tabella</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>DROP DATABASE</code>, perché una tabella può essere rimossa soltanto insieme al suo database</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>DROP TABLE</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 121025,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale delle seguenti è la sintassi corretta per eliminare una tabella?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>DROP TABLE tablename</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>DROP tablename</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>DROP TABLE tablename</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vuoi eliminare la tabella chiamata <code>sessions</code>. Quale istruzione usa la sintassi corretta?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>DROP TABLE sessions</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>DROP sessions</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>DROP sessions TABLE</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>DROP TABLE sessions</code>.</p></body></html>"
